<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">Nehemia</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemia</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemia</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hei hi Nehemia thiltih chanchin ziakna bu a ni. Lal Artazerzia lal kum sawmhnihna, Kislev thla chuan lal khawpui Susa khuaah ka awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka unau zînga mi Hanania leh mi dang ṭhenkhat Jerusalem aṭangin an lo kal a, Juda saltâng, Babulon aṭanga hâwng chanchin leh Jerusalem khaw chanchin ka lo zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Judai rama haw, saltâng chhuakho chu an rethei hle mai; an vêla awm hnam dangte chuan an hmusit êm êm a ni. Jerusalem kulh bang pawh a chim chhe vek a, a kawngkhârte pawh a kâng zo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thu ka hriat chuan ka ṭhu a, ka ṭap a, lungngai takin ni tam fe chu ka awm a, chaw ngheiin vân Pathian hnênah ka ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , Pathian ropui leh hlauhawm, nangmah hmangaihtu leh i thupêk zâwmtute tân i thuthlung chu i vuan tlat ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Min rawn en la, ka lamah i beng han chhi teh; i chhiahhlawh, i mi Israel-te tân a chhun a zân i hnênah ka rawn ṭawngṭai hi. Keini Israel-te hian i lakah thil kan tisual a ni. Kei leh min thlahtute hi kan sual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I lakah khawlo takin kan khawsa a, Mosia hnêna i hrilh, i thupêk te, i thuruatte, awm dân tûr i tih te kan zâwm duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh Mosia hetiang thu i hrilh kha hre reng ang che, ‘Khawlo taka in awm chuan hnam tinrêng zîngah ka tidarh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hnêna in lo kîr duha, ka thupêkte in pawma in zawm chuan vân tâwp daihah pawh kal darh ula, chuta ṭang chuan ka hruai ang che u a, ka hming awmna tûra ka thlan ramah chuan ka hruai khâwm leh ang che u,’ i tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng i chhiahhlawhte hi i mite chu an ni, ropui taka i bân tha chaka i tlanchhuahte an nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i chhiahhlawh ṭawngṭaina hi lo ngaithla teh, nangmah ṭihtu i chhiahhlawhte dîlna hi lo ngaihven ang che. Vawiinah pawh hian lal chuan min lo khawngaih teh se,” ka ti a. Chûng lai chuan lal no petu ka ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat chu lal Artazerzia chuan a lal kum sawmhnihna, Nisan thlaah chaw a ei a, uain chu ka pe a, lungngai hmêl ka put a la hmu ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, “Engtizia nge i hmêl a va ngui ve? Lungngaih rûkna i nei em ni? I dam lo pawh a ni si lo,” tiin min zâwt a. Ka phu zawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lal hnênah chuan, “Lal chu dam reng rawh se; ka pa thlân awmna khawpui chu tihram a ni a, a kulh kawngkhârte a kâng zo vek si a, ngui lo thei em ka nih?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lal chuan, “Eng nge i tih duh?” min ti a. Vâna Pathian hnênah chuan ka ṭawngṭai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lal hnênah chuan, “Lal remtih zâwng a niha, min duhsak takmeuh chuan Judai ramah min kaltîr la, ka pa thlân awmna khuaah ka han kal ang a, ka han siam ṭha ang e,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalnu pawh a bulah a ṭhu a, lal chuan, “Eng chen nge i thang ang a, engtikah nge i lo kîr leh ang?” min ti a. Ka hâwn leh hun tûr ka hrilh a, lal chuan ka kal a phal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal hnênah chuan heti hian ka ti bawk: “Lalin rem a tih chuan Eufretis lui khawthlang lam bial awptute chu Judai ram ka thlen thlenga an biala ka kal phal tûrin hrilh ni sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lal ngawpui vêngtu Asafa hnênah pawh Tempul luhna kawngkhâr tûr te, khawpui bangah te leh ka awmna tûr in sak nân thing min pe tûrin hrilh ni teh se,” ka ti a. Pathianin min awmpui avângin lal chuan ka dîl apiang chu rem a ti zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lal chuan sakawr chungchuang mi sipai rual khat leh an hotute ka ruala kal tûrin a tîr a; Eufretis lui thlang lam ram bialah chuan kan kal ta a, ramawptute hnênah lehkha chu ka pe zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Beth-horon khaw mi Sanbalata leh Amon biala sawrkâr milian pakhat chuan an lo hriatin Israel mite ṭhatna tûra thawktu tûr lo kal chu an duh lo hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem khua chu ka han thleng a, ni thum ka châwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathianin Jerusalem khaw tâna thil tih tûr min pêk chu tu mah ka hrilh lo. Zanlaiah ka tho va, ka ṭhian ṭhenkhatte nên kan chhuak a, ka chuanna sabengtung tih chauh lo chu chuanna tûr sakawr pakhat mah kan keng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zânah chuan khawthlang lam ruam panin kawngkaah khua kan chhuahsan a, chhim lam panin Dragon Tuikhur lamah kan kal a. Bawlhhlawh paihna Kawngka kan thleng a, kal pah chuan kulh bang chim chu ngun takin ka en zêl a; kawngkhâr kâng chhiate pawh chu ka en a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khawpui chhak lamah, hmâr lam panin kan kal zêl a; Tuikhur Kawngka leh lal tuikhuah kan va thleng a, ka chuanna sabengtung chu lung chim rem rum zîngah chuan a kal tlang thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Kidron lui ruam lamah kan kal a, kulh bang chu ka thlîr zui zêl a. Ka kalna hnuah khân ka kîr leh a, Ruam luhna kawngkhârah khân khuaah chuan ka lût leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuaa sawrkâr mi tu mahin khawiah nge ka kala, eng nge ka tih an hre lo. Ka Juda-pui, puithiam te, hruaitu te, sawrkâr mi te leh kan hna thawh tûr hmabâk thawktu tûrte hnênah pawh eng mah ka la sawi lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An hnênah chuan heti hian ka han ti ta a: “Jerusalem kulh chu a chhe vek a, kawngkhârte lah a kâng zo va, thil ṭha lo tinrêngin min tlâkbuak ta a nih hi. Khawpui kulh hi i siam ṭha ang u khai. Heti taka nuihzatbûr hi kan ni dâwn lo nia,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathianin min awmpui a, min ṭanpui dân te, leh lalin thu min pêkte chu ka hrilh ta a. Anni chuan, “Kulh bang chim i siam ṭha tak ang u hmiang,” tiin min chhâng a. Hna thawk ṭan tûr chuan an insiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Beth-horon mi Sanbalata te, Amon mi Tobia te leh Arab mi pakhat Gesema ten kan thiltih tum chu an lo hriat chuan min nuihzatbûr a, hmusit takin, “Eng nge tih in tum vei le? Lal lakah hel in tum elo maw?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kei chuan, “Vân Pathianin min ṭanpui dâwn alâwm. A chhiahhlawhte kan ni a, kulh bang hi kan siam ṭha dâwn a ni. Jerusalem khaw chhûngah hian neih eng mah in nei lo va, Jerusalem mi nihna lah in nei ve hek lo,” tiin ka chhâng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hetiang hian Jerusalem khaw kulh bang chim chu siam leh a ni: Puithiam lalber Eliasiba leh a puitu puithiamte tum chu Berâm Kawngkhâr siam ṭhat a ni. An siam a, an hlân a, an vuah a, kulh bang pawh Hamea in sâng leh Hananela in sâng thleng ve vein an siam ṭha a, an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A dawt siam ṭhat chu Jeriko mite tum a ni. Chumi dawt chu Imria fa Zakura ho tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hasena thlahten Sangha Kawngkhâr chu an siam a; a kawngka biangte an vuah a, a kalhnate leh a bahnate an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A dawt chu Uria fa, Hakoza tupa Meremota hovin an siam a. Chumi dawt leh chu Berekia fa, Mesezebela tupa Mesulama hovin an siam a, a dawt chu Baana fapa Zadoka hovin an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A dawt leh chu Tekoa khaw mite tum a ni; khaw milianho chuan hotute tuk ang chuan an thawk ve duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasea fapa Joiada leh Besodeia fapa Mesulama hovin Jesana Kawngkhâr an siam a. A kawngkabiang te, a kawngkhâr te, a kalhna te leh a bahna te an vuah vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gibeona mi Melatia te, Meronot mi Jadona te chuan Gibeon leh Mizpa khaw mite nên a dawt, Eufretis thlang lam ramawptu awmna zâwn thlengin an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rangkachak chher mi Harhaia fapa Uziela hovin a dawt leh chu an siam a. Chumi dawt chu bang chhah lai thlengin rimtui siam mi Hanania hovin an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jerusalem khua leh a chhehvêl ram zâtve hotu Hura fapa Refaia hovin a dawt chu an siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi dawt leh chu Harumafa fapa Jedaia hovin ama in bul chu an siam a. A dawt leh chu Hasabneia fapa Hatusa hovin an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harima fapa Malkija leh Pahat-moaba fapa Hasuba te chuan a dawt chu Meichhehna In sâng an tih nên chuan an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem leh a chhehvêl ram zâtve hotu Halohesa fapa Saluma hovin a dawt leh chu an siam a, a fanute pawhin an thawk ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ruam kalna kawngkhâr chu Hanuna leh Zanoa khaw miten an siam a. A kawngka te, a biang te, a kalhna te, a bahna te an vuah vek a; kulh bang pawh Bawlhhlawh Kawngkhâr thlengin tawng sângkhata sei an siam bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rekaba fapa Malkija, Hakerem bial hotu chuan Bawlhhlawh Kawngkhâr chu a siam a. Kawngkhâr chu a vuah a, a kalhnate leh a bahnate pawh a siam vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kolhozea fapa Saluma, Mizpa bial hotu chuan Tuikhur Kawngka chu a siam a. Kawngka luchung bang pawh a rem a, a kawngkhâr chu a kalhnate leh a bahnate nên a vuah a, Lal huan bula Sela dîl zâwn bang chu Davida khaw panna kailâwn awmna thlengin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azbuka fapa Nehemia, Beth-zur bial zâtve awptu chuan a dawt leh chu Davida thlân te, tuikhuah te leh sipai bûk thleng chuan a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hêng Levia chite hian a dawt, ṭhen tam fe chu an siam a ni. Bania fapa Rehuma hovin a dawt chu an siam a. Hasabia, Keila bial zâtve awptu chuan a bial hmingin a dawt chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Henadada fapa Bavaia, Keila bial zâtve awptu chuan a dawt chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jesua fapa Ezera, Mizpa bial hotu chuan râlthuam dahna zâwn chu kulh bang kawi ṭanna thlengin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zabaia fapa Baruka hovin phûr takin a dawt chu Puithiam lalber Eliasiba awmna thlengin an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Uria fa, Hakoza tupa Meremota hovin a dawt chu Puithiam lalber Eliasiba in tâwp zâwn thlengin an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng puithiamho hian a dawt leh, ṭhen tam fe chu an siam ṭha a ni. Jerusalem khaw chhehvêla puithiam awmho chuan a dawt chu an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Benjamina leh Hasuba chuan a dawt bang, an in zâwn chu an siam a. Maaseia fapa, Amazia tupa Azaria chuan a dawt, ama in zâwn chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Henadada fapa, Binuia hovin a dawt, Azaria in zâwn aṭanga kulh bang kawina thlengin an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uzia fapa Palala hovin bang kawina aṭang chuan vêngtuho awmna, lal in chungnung zâwk bul thlengin an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Parosa fapa Pedaia hovin a dawt khawchhak lam chu Tuikhur Kawngka, Tempul bula in sâng awmna thlengin an siam a. He lai vêl hi Tempul enkawltu Netin-ho awmna a ni, a hmingah ‘ofel’ an vuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tekoa khaw mite chuan an chan hnihna, a dawt chu an siam a; Tempul bula In sâng leh Ofel mual tâwp inkâr chu an siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mi ṭhenkhat, kulh bang bula in neite chuan, a dawt leh, anmahni in zâwn ṭheuh, Sakawr Kawngka aṭanga hmâr lam chu an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Imera fapa Zadoka chuan a dawt, a in zâwn chu a siam a. Chumi dawt chu Sekania fapa Semaia, khawchhak kawngka vêngtu chuan a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Selemia fapa Hanania leh Zalafa fapa parukna Hanuna te chuan a dawt, an chan hnihna chu an siam a. Berekia fapa Mesulama chuan a dawt, ama in zâwn chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Rangkachak chher mi Malkija chuan, a dawt leh chu Tempul enkawltute leh sumdâwngho riahna in, Hamifkad an tih kawngka bul, hmârchhak bang kil thlengin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kil aṭanga Berâm Kawngka thleng chuan rangkachak chhertu leh sumdâwngte chuan an siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanbalatan kulh siam kan tum a hriat chuan a thin a rim nasa mai a, Juda-te chu min sâwt ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thawhpuite leh Samaria khuaa sipaite hnênah, “Hêng Juda-ho, pa pawr tak tak hian eng nge maw an hriata Jerusalem khawpui din leh an tum le? Inthawina hlânin ni khat thil thu-ah siam zawh mai an tum em ni? A chim chhe vûm, kâng nek tawh lungte chu siam ṭhat leh theih an inbeisei em ni le!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tobia chu a bulah a ding a, “Eng ang kulh bang nge an din theih ang? Sihal pawh lâwn se a chim mai ang!” a lo ti ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei chu ka ṭawngṭai ta a, “Aw Pathian, hêng mite min deusawhzia hi lo ngaithla teh, min hmuhsitna chu an chungah lêt teh se. An neih zawng zawng miin rawk sela; ram dang daihah sal atân man ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An thil sual tih hi theihnghilh suh la, an sualna pawh hai suh ang che; kulh bang siamṭhatute hmaah an chêksawlh hle che kha,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kulh bang siam ṭhat hna chu ngawrh takin kan thawk a, a zâtve dâwn laia sâng chu kan zo ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sanbalata te, Tobia te, Arabia mi te, Amon mi te leh Asdod mi te chuan Jerusalem kulh chu kan siam ṭha sâwt hle a, a bal chhe laite chu kan thawm leh vek tawh tih an hriat chuan an thinur hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem-a lo kala, min rawn beiha, min tihbuai tumin an thurual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian hnênah kan ṭawngṭai a, a chhûn a zâna vêngtu tûr kan insiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Judai rama mite chuan hla an phuah a, “Rit tak tak kan phur a, kan hah zo ta, A chhe nawi paih tûr a tam êm a, Bang pawh kan rem hman lo!” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan hmêlmate lah chuan min zuam hle a, “Kan han beiha kan thaha, an hna kan tihtâwpsak hma chu eng mah an hre lo vang, hmuh pawh min hmu lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, an zînga Juda awm vete chuan an thil tum chu a rûkin min rawn hrilh zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, mipuite chu khandaih te, fei te, thal te ka pe a; a chi chiin, bang la rem zawh loh bulah vêngtu atân ka sem darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipuite chu an thlaphâng hle tih ka hriat chuan an hruaitute leh an hotute nên an hnênah, “Anniho hi hlau suh u; Lalpa ropuizia leh a hlauhawmzia hre reng rawh u. In unaute hi vêng ula, in nupui fanau leh in in leh lo tân ṭang rawh u,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kan hmêlmate chuan an thil tih tum chu kan lo hria tih an hriat chuan Pathianin an thiltum chu a tibahlah a ni tih an hria a; keini chuan kan za-in kulh bang siam chu kan chhunzawm leh ta sauh sauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuta chin chu ka mite zâtve chuan an thawk a, a zâtve chuan fei te, phaw te, thal te an keng a; awmphaw te an ha a. Hnam hruaitute chuan kulh bang siamtute chu theihtâwp chhuahin an pui zêl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hnathawktute pawh chuan khingkhatin hna an thawk a, khingkhatin hriam an keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu pawhin, khandaih a kawm nên an pai ṭheuh va. Tawtawrâwtpu, râlkhêl hâmtu tûr chu ka bulah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mipuite chu an hruaitute leh hotute nên, “Kan hna thawh hi hmun hrang hranga thawk kan ni a, kan thawhna lai bang a inhlat hle hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chuvângin, tawtawrâwt ri in hriat chuan ka awmnaah lo tlân khâwm ang che u, kan Pathian chuan râl chu min dopui dâwn a ni,” tiin ka hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ni tin, khâwvâr aṭanga arsi lan thlengin a zâtve chuan hna kan thawk a, a zâtve chuan fei nên min vêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hnathawk hotute hnênah chuan, “Nangni leh in chhiahhlawhte chu Jerusalem khaw chhûngah riak ve mai ula a ṭha ang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka ṭhian te, ka ṭhuihruai te, ka chhiahhlawh te, kei ngei pawhin, zânah pawh kawr kan hlîp lo va, râlthuam kan dah hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Rei fe hnuah chuan mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh, an Juda-puite chungah an vui ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Kan chhûng kan rual a, rilṭâma kan thih loh nân ei tûr kan duh a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ṭhen chuan, “Kan lo te, kan grep huan te, kan in te, rilṭâma thih ai chuan kan lo ineiba tawh a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ṭhen chuan, “Kan lo te, grep huan te dahkhamin lal chhiah pêk tûr tangka kan pûk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Juda mi ve bawk kan ni si a, kan fate pawh Juda dang fate ang bawk an ni lâwm ni? Nimahsela, hei kan fate chu bawihah kan tântîr a, kan fanute phei chu bawihah kan hralh dêr tawh a ni. Kan lote leh grep huante min neihsak zo tawh a, kan che hlei thei ta hauh lo mai,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An vui thu ka hriatin ka thinur hle a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka rilru ka siam a, mipui hruaitute leh an hotute chu ka khak ta a, “In unaute ngei in lo tiduhdah hle a lo nih hi,” ka ti a. Chumi chungchâng chu ngaihtuah tûrin vântlâng ka ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kan theih ang angin kan Juda-pui, hnam dang hnêna inhralh hialte chu tlan chhuah kan tum hrâm ṭhîn a. In unaute hi anmahni Juda-puite hnênah in inhralhtîr ta hial a nih hi,” ka ti a. Hruaitute chuan min chhâng thei lo va, an ngawi ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“In thil tih hi a dik hauh lo, Pathian ṭih ula, thil dik ti rawh u. Tichuan, kan hmêlma, Jentail-ho hian min hmusit lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei pawhin mite chu pawisa leh buhte ka lo pûktîr tawh ṭhîn a; chutiangin ka ṭhuihruaite pawhin an ti ṭhîn. Kan leibate chu i ngaidam teh ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An ba zawng zawng, tangka te, buh te, uain te, oliv hriak te ngaidam vek ila, an lo te, an grep huante leh an oliv hmunte chu pe kîr leh vek rawh u,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hruaitute chuan, “I sawi ang chuan kan ti ang e, an thil chu kan pe kîr ang a, an ba chu kan ngaidam ang,” an ti a. Puithiamho chu ka ko va, an hmaah chuan hruaitute chu an sawi ang chuan thu ka tiamtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka puan ven chu ka thing thla a. “In thutiam anga ti duh lo chu Pathianin a thing ang a, a inte leh a neih zawng zawng a thin thlâksak ve ang a, eng mah a nei lo vang,” ka ti a. Chuta awm ve zawng zawng chuan, “Amen” an ti a. Lalpa an fak a, hruaitute chuan an tiam ang chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lal Artazerzia lal kum sawmhnihna aṭanga kum sawmthum leh pahnihna, Judai ram awptua kum sâwm leh kum hnih ka ṭan chhûng chuan ka chhûngte nên Ramawptu ei tûr ang kan ei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hmaa Ramawptute chu mipui tân an rit hle a, ni tin, tangka sawmli man chaw leh uain an phût ṭhîn a; an chhiahhlawhte pawh rit tham tak an ni. Pathian ka zah avângin chutiang chu ka ti ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kulh bang chu theihtâwp chhuahin kan siam zêl a, ram lei ve zai pawh ka rêl hman lo. Ka hnuaia thawktute pawhin kulh bang siam ngawt an ngaihtuah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kan vêla mi, kan mikhual ṭhînte bâkah, Juda hruaitute leh mi dang mi za leh sawmnga vêl chu chaw ka eipui ziah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni tin bâwngpa pakhat leh berâm thlan chhuah paruk kan talh a ngai a, ârte pawh min talhsak ṭhîn; ni sâwm danah uain chi tinrêng kan chhawp bawk ṭhîn; mipui tân a rih êm avângin Ramawptu phût theih chin chu ka phût ve ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Aw ka Pathian, he mite tâna ka thiltih zawng zawng hi ka chan ṭhat nân hre reng ang che,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sanbalata te, Tobia te, Arab mi Gesema te leh kan hmêlma te chuan Jerusalem kulh bang chu kan siam ṭha a, a kawngkhârte la vuah lo mah ila a chim chhe laite chu kan thawm zo vek tih an lo hriat chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sanbalata leh Gesema chuan thu an rawn thawn a, “Lo kal la, Ono phaia khaw pakhatah i inbe teh ang,” an rawn ti a, min khawih theih nân min bum an tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lamkal ka tîr a, “Hna pawimawh tak ka thawk a, ka lo kal chhuk thei lo. Nangni be tûrin ka lo chhuak hman lo, ka hna ka tibahlah thei lo,” ka tihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vawi li, thu ngai hlîr an rawn sawi a, a ngai hlîrin ka lo chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sanbalata chuan a chhiahhlawh pakhat lehkha kengin, a vawi nganaah chuan a rawn tîr a, a lehkha chu châr loh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hetiang hian a ziak: “Gesema chuan, nang leh Juda-ho hian lal lakah hel in tum a; chuvângin, Jerusalem khaw kulh pawh in siam ṭha leh a ni, tih
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />kan chhehvêl hnamho zîngah hian thu a thang huai huai a ni. Nang lahin lal i tum a, Jerusalem khuaah Judai ram lala puang tûr che zâwlnei pawh i nei reng tawh a ni, tih min hrilh a. Lal ropuia chuan a lo hre ve ngei ang a; chuvângin, he thil hi chîk takin i lo sawi dûn teh ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hetiang hian ka chhâng a, “I sawi hi dâwt vek a ni, i phuahchawp a ni ta ve ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hna tihtâwp tumin min vau a ni, ka ṭawngṭai a, “Khai le, aw ka Pathian, min tichak teh,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Delaia fa, Mehetabela tupa, Semaia inah ka kal a, a in aṭangin a lo chhuak thei lo va ni. Ani chuan Hmun Thianghlimah kan pahnihin kan biru ang a, kawngkhâr kan inkalh hnan tûr a ni; thah tum chein an lo kal dâwn, eng zânah pawh an lo kal mai thei a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Chutianga tlânchhiaa biru mai âwm mi ka ni lo ve, inhumhim nân Tempul chhûnga biru duhin min ring em ni? Ka biru hauh lo vang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka han inngaihtuah chiang a, Semaia chu Pathianin a be awzâwng lo tih ka hre ta a. Tobia leh Sanbalatan chutianga min tihṭhaih tûr chuan an tham a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thil sual ti tûra min tihṭhaih tûrin an ruai a lo ni a; ka hming tihchhiata, min tihmualpho an tum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ṭawngṭai a, “Aw ka Pathian, Tobia leh Sanbalata thil tih dân hi hre reng la, tuartîr ang che, Zâwlneinu Noadii leh zâwlnei dang min tihzâm tumtute pawh hi hre reng ang che,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sawmnga leh pahnih hna kan thawh hnu, Elul thla, ni sawmhnih leh panga ni chuan kulh bang chu kan siam ṭha ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan hmêlmate leh kan vêla awm hnamte chuan an lo hriatin an hlau hle a, kan Pathian hna thawh a ni tih an hriatin an meng hnuai ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hêng hun lai hian Tobia leh Juda hruaitute chu lehkha an inthawn fo ṭhîn a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judai rama mi tam tak chu a puzawn Sekania, Ara fapa avângin a lamṭang an ni. Tobia fapa Johanana chuan Berekia fapa Mesulama fanu nupuiah a nei nghe nghe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi tam takin ka hriat ngei tûrah Tobia ṭhatzia sawi nuam an ti hle a; ka sawi apiang pawh an lo hrilh zêl bawk ṭhîn. Mi tihṭhaih tumin lehkha pawh min rawn thawn fo va ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kulh bang chu an siam zo va, kulh kawngkhârte pawh chu an vuah fel vek a, Tempul pulis te, zaipâwl te leh Levia chi te chu an tih tûr an ruat fel vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khaw awptu tûr mi pahnih ka ruat a, pakhat chu ka nau Hanania a ni a, pakhat chu sipai pâwl hotu Hananaia, tu ma tluk loh, mi rin tlâk tak, Pathian ṭih mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem kulh kawngkhârte chu zîngah, ni chhuah hnu chauhva hawng tûrin ka ti a; tlaiah pawh ni tlâk, vêngtuho ṭina khâr tûrin ka ti a. Jerusalem khuaa mi ṭhenkhat pawh kawngkhâr vên bîk nei tûr leh khawlai vênga fang ṭhîntu ruat tûrin ka ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem hi khaw zau tak a ni a, mi an tam lo va, in pawh an la sa ṭan leh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipui chu an hruaitute leh an hotute nên ka khâwm a, an chhûngkaw chanchin ziakna chhui feltîr tûrin Pathianin min ti a. Saltâng chhuak hmasate hming ziakna ka zawng chhuak a, hei hi ka hmuh dân chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saltâng tam tak chu Babulon bial aṭangin Jerusalem leh Judai ramah mahni awmna ṭhin khuaah an haw a. An chhûngkuain lal Nebukadnezaran sala a man aṭang khân Babulon-ah an tâng reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An hruaitute chu Zerubabela te, Jesua te, Nehemia te, Azaria te, Raamia te, Nahamania te, Mordekaia te, Bilsana te, Mispereta te, Bigvaia te, Nehuma te leh Baana te an ni. Israel mi, chi hrang hrang lo kîr zât chu hetiang hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Paros chi aṭangin mi sânghnih leh za leh sawmsarih leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sefatia chi aṭangin mi zathum leh sawmsarih leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ara chi aṭangin mi zaruk leh sawmnga leh pahnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pahat-moab chi, Jesua leh Joaba thlah aṭangin mi sânghnih leh zariat leh sâwm leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elam chi aṭangin mi sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmnga leh pali.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zatu chi aṭangin mi zariat leh sawmli leh panga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zakai chi aṭangin mi zasarih leh sawmruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Binui chi aṭangin mi zaruk leh sawmli leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bebai chi aṭangin mi zaruk leh sawmhnih leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azgad chi aṭangin mi sânghnih leh zathum leh sawmhnih leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adonikam chi aṭangin mi zaruk leh sawmruk leh pasarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bigvai chi aṭangin mi sânghnih leh sawmruk leh pasarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adin chi aṭangin mi zaruk leh sawmnga leh panga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ater (Hezekia an ti bawk) chi aṭangin mi sawmkua leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hasum chi aṭangin mi zathum leh sawmhnih leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bezai chi aṭangin mi zathum leh sawmhnih leh pali.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Harif chi aṭangin mi za leh sâwm leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon chi aṭangin mi sawmkua leh panga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bethlehem leh Netofa khaw chhuak mi za leh sawmriat leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathot khaw chhuak mi za leh sawmhnih leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Beth-azmavet khaw chhuak mi sawmli leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kiriat-jearim te, Kafira te leh Beerot khaw chhuak mi zasarih leh sawmli leh pathum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rama leh Geba khaw chhuak mi zaruk leh sawmhnih leh pakhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mikmas khaw chhuak mi za leh sawmhnih leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bethel leh Ai khaw chhuak mi za leh sawmhnih leh pathum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nebo khaw dang chhuak mi sawmnga leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Elam khaw dang chhuak mi sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmnga leh pali.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harim khaw chhuak mi zathum leh sawmhnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jeriko khaw chhuak mi zathum leh sawmli leh panga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lod te, Hadid te leh Ono khaw chhuak mi zasarih leh sawmhnih leh pakhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sena khaw chhuak mi sângthum leh zakua leh sawmthum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Puithiamho lo kîr vete chu heti hi an ni: Jesua chhûng, Jedaia thlah mi zakua leh sawmsarih leh pathum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Imera thlahte mi sângkhat leh sawmnga leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pasura thlahte mi sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmli leh pasarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Harima thlahte mi sângkhat leh sâwm leh pasarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Levia chi saltâng lo kîrte chu heti hi an ni Jesua te, Kadmiela te, Hodavia thlahte, mi sawmsarih leh pali.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tempula hla sa mi: Asafa thlahte mi za leh sawmli leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tempul pulis: Saluma te, Atera te, Talmona te, Akuba te, Hatita te leh Sobaia te thlah mi za leh sawmthum leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tempul enkawltute: Ziha te, Hasufa te, Tabaota te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kerosa te, Sia te, Padona te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lebana te, Hagaba te, Salmaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hanana te, Gidela te, Gahara te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Reaia te, Rezina te, Nekoda te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gazama te, Uza te, Pasea te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Besaia te, Meunima te, Nefusesima te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bakbuka te, Hakufa te, Harhura te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bazlita te, Mehida te, Harsa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Barkosa te, Sisera te, Tema te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nezia te leh Hatifa te hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Solomona chhiahhlawh thlahte: Sotaia te, Sofereta te, Perida te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jaala te, Darkona te, Gidela te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Sefatia te, Hatila te, Pokeret-hazebaima te, Amona te hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Tempul enkawltu leh Solomona chhiahhlawh, saltâng haw zawng zawng mi zathum leh sawmkua leh pahnih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tel-mela khua aṭang te, Tel-harsa khua aṭang te, Kerub khua aṭang te, Adoa khua aṭang te, Imer khua aṭang tea lo kal chho vete chu heti hi an ni. Hêngho hian Israel thlah an nihna chiang leh an chi leh kuang an chhui thei lo:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Chûng chu Delaia thlah te, Tobia thlah te, Nekoda thlah te, an vaiin mi zaruk leh sawmli leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Hêng puithiamho hian an thlahtu tak an chhui thei lo: Hobaia fate, Hakosa fate, Barzilaia fate. Puithiam Barzilaia fate thlahtu Barzilaia hian Gilead mi Barzilai hmeichhia a nei a, a puzawn chhûng hnam hming chu an pu zawm ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />An thlahtu tak an chhui chhuah theih loh avângin puithiamah pawm an ni ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Juda zînga an hotu ber, Tirsatha chuan, “Urim leh Thumim kawltu puithiam a awm hma chu Pathian hnêna thilhlan hi lo ei ve suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Saltâng haw chu an vaiin mi sîngli leh sânghnih leh zathum leh sawmruk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />An chhiahhlawh, mipa leh hmeichhia sângsarih leh zathum leh sawmthum leh pasarih. Hla sa mi, mipa leh hmeichhia zahnih leh sawmli leh panga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Sakawr zasarih leh sawmthum leh paruk; sakawr puakphur zahnih leh sawmli leh panga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />sanghâwngsei zali leh sawmthum leh panga, sabengtung sângruk leh zasarih leh sawmhnih an rawn hruai bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Hnam tin hruaitute chuan Tempul sakna thawhlâwm an pe ṭheuh va. An Tirsatha chuan rangkachak kg. riat, maihûn sawmnga, puithiam kawr tûr puan zanga leh sawmthum a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Israel hnam hruaitute chuan rangkachak kg. za leh sawmruk leh pariat, tangkarua kg. Sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmnga an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Mipuite chuan: Rangkachak kg. za leh sawmruk leh pariat, tangkarua kg. za leh sawmli, puithiam kawr tûr puan sawmruk leh pasarih an pe bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Puithiam te, Levia chi te, Tempul pulis te, hla sa mite leh mi dang leh Tempul enkawltute - Israel mi zawng zawng chuan Judai ram khuaahte chuan awmhmun an bêngbel ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thla sarihnaah chuan Israel mite chu an awmna tûr khuaah an awm fel hman a; Jerusalem khaw Tuikhur Kawngkhâr bul tualzâwl laiah chuan, chumi thla, ni khat ni chuan an lo pung khâwm a; Israel te zawm tûr, Lalpa dân, Mosia hnêna pêk chu hre tak puithiam Ezra chu an ngên a, Dân bu chu an lâktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ezra chuan mipui punkhâwmnaah, mipa leh hmeichhia, naupangte pawh, a hrethiam pha âwm chin hmaah chuan Dân bu chu a rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kawngkhâr bul tualzâwl zau laiah chuan khawvâr aṭangin chhûn lai thlengin, Dân bu chu a chhiar a, ngun takin an ngaithla ṭhuap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thingphel dawhkân siamah chuan Dânhremi Ezra chu a ding a, a ding lamah Matithia te, Sema te, Anaia te, Uria te, Hilkia te, Maaseia te an ding a; a vei lamah Pedaia te, Misaela te, Malkija te, Hasuma te, Hasbadana te, Zekaria te, Mesulama te an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ezra dinna chu a sâng bîk a, mi zawng zawngin an hmu thei a. Dân bu chu a han phelh chuan mipui chu an ding vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ezra chuan Lalpa , Pathian ropui chu a fak a, mipui chuan, “Amen, Amen,” tiin an lo chhâwn a, an kûn a, Lalpa hmaah chuan an bawkkhup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An tho va, mahni hmun ṭheuhvah an ding a, Levia chi Jesua te, Bania te, Serebia te, Jamina te, Akuba te, Sebethaia te, Hodia te, Maaseia te, Kelita te, Azaria te, Jozabada te, Hanana te, Pelaia te chuan an lo sawi fiah zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dân bu thu chu an tualṭawngin an let chawp a, mipui hriat theih tûrin an sawi fiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An tih tûra Dân bu-in a phût chu mipuiin an han hriat chuan an rilru a khawih hle a, an ṭap ta hlawm a. Tichuan, an Tirsatha Nehemia te, puithiam leh Dânhremi Ezra te, Dân thu sawifiahtu Levia chite chuan mite hnênah, “Vawiin hi Lalpa , in Pathianni thianghlim a ni, in ṭap tûr a ni lo va, in ngui tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Haw ula, ruai ṭheh rawh u. In uain leh chaw chu a nei ve lote eipui ang che u. Vawiin hi kan Lalpa tân ni serh a ni a, ngui suh u, Lalpa -a in lâwmna chu in chakna a ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levia chite chuan mipui chu, “Vawiin ni thianghlim angah hian ṭap teh suh u, a ngui pawh ngui hek suh u,” tiin mipui ṭap chu an thlêm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mite chu an in lamah an haw a, hlim takin an eiin an in a, mi dangte pawh an neih ang chu an pe a, an hnêna Dân thu an chhiar kha an hriat avângin an lâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tûkah chuan hnam tin hruaitu te, puithiam te leh Levia chi te chu Dânhremi Ezra hnênah Dân thu zir tûrin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hmangin Israel-te zawm tûr Dân a pe a, chu Dân bu-ah chuan Bâwkte kût chhûng chhâwlbûkah an awm ṭhîn tûr a ni tih an hmu chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Jerusalem leh khaw dang zawng zawngah hetiang hian thu an pe a; “Tlângahte kal ula, oliv zâr te, umkhal zâr te, lenhmui zâr te, tumkau te leh thingbuk chhah te sât ula, dân bu-a chuang angin chhâwlbûk siam rawh u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mite chuan chhâwl chu an sât a, an in chung zâwlah te, an tualah te, Tempul tualah te, khawlai zau laiah Tuikhur Kawngkhâr leh Efraim Kawngkhâr bulah te chuan chhâwlbûk an sa ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saltâng lo haw zawng zawng chuan bûk an sa a, tah chuan an riak a, Nuna fapa Josua thih hnu kha chuan hetianga an tih hmasak ber ṭum a ni a; an tha a thovin an phûr hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kût ṭan tirh ni aṭanga a tâwp ni thlengin ni tin Dân bu-a mi an chhiar ziah a ni. Ni sarih chhûng chu kût an hmang a, a ni riat ni chuan inkhâwm urhsûn tak neiin kût chu an ṭiak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi thla, ni sawmhnih leh pali ni chuan Israel mite chu an kal khâwm a, saiip puan sinin chaw an nghei a, an lu-ah lei an phul a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel mite chu hnam dang lakah an inthiarfihlîm tawh a, an ding a, anmahni sualna leh an thlahtute khawlohna avângin thupha an chawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa , an Pathian Dân chu dârkâr thum vêl an chhiar a, dârkâr thum dang an sual thupha chawi nân an hmang a, Lalpa an Pathian chu chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Levia chite tâna an dawhkân siamah chuan Jesua te Bania te Kadmiela te Sebania te Bunia te Serebia te Bania te Kenania te pawh an ding ve a. Lalpa , an Pathian hnênah ring takin an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Levia chi Jesua te, Kadmiela te, Bania te, Hasabneia te, Serebia te, Hodia te, Sebania te, Pethahia te chuan mipui chu Pathian be tûrin an sâwm a: “Ding ula, Lalpa , in Pathian chu kumkhuain fak rawh u. Fak sên rual ni lo mah se, a hming ropui chu mi tinin fak rawh se,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mite chu hetiang hian an ṭawngṭai a: “Aw Lalpa , nang chauh hi Lalpa chu i ni, Vânte leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte, Lei leh tuifinriatte leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng te hi i siam vek a ni; An za-in i vawng ṭha ṭhîn a. Vâna awmhote chuan chibai an bûk ṭhîn che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang Pathian chuan Abrama i ko va, Kaldai ram Ur khua ata i hruai chhuak a, A hmingah Abrahama i sa ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A zui tlat che avângin thuthlung i siamsak ta a, Kanan ram chu pêk i tiam a, Hit mi leh Amor mite awmna ram Periz-ho te, Jebus-ho te, Girgas-ho te awmna ram chu, A thlahte awm nân i pêk kha. I rinawm a, i thutiam i hlen ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Min thlahtute Aigupta rama an retheihzia i hria a, Tuipui Senah an mangang au i ngaihthlâk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An lal leh hotute chungah, an ram chungah nên Thil mak tak tak i ti ṭeuh va, I mite an tihduhdahzia i hria a ni, Tûn thlengin i hmingthan phah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I mite tân tuipui laiah kawng i siam a, Leichârah i hruai kai kha. Ûmtute chu tui thûkah an pil a, Tuipui fâwn vêla lungtum pil ang vang vang an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chhûnah chhûm dingin i hruai a, Zânah mei êngin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vân ata i lo chhuk a, Sinai tlângah khân, I mite chu i rawn bia a, Awm dân tûr thuruat ṭha te, Thupêk leh Dân nghet te i pe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sabat ni chu serh ṭha tûrin i ti a, I chhiahhlawh Mosia hmangin i dân chu i hrilh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An rilṭâm khân vân chaw i pe a, An tuihâl khân lungpui ata in tûr i pe. An hnêna pêk i tiam ram chu nei tûrin thu i pêk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Min thlahtute chu an inchhuang a, an luhlul hle, I thupêkte chu an awih duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I thu an awih lo va, thil mak i tihsakte an hre duh lo, Luhlul an chhuah a, an hel ta a. Aigupta bawiha hruai lût leh tûr hotu an thlang. Lainatnaa khat thinnel i ni a, I ngaidam peih zêl a, i thlahthlam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Milem, bâwngno lem an siam a, “Hei hi Aigupta ram ata min hruaichhuaktu, Thil mak tam tak min tihsaktu kha a ni,” an ti. Aw Lalpa , an va tinawmnah che êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngil i neih êm avângin Thlalêrah khân i thlahthlam lo. Chhûn leh zâna hruai ṭhîntu chhûm ding leh mei chu i la bo lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dawhthei takin i zirtîr hrâm hrâm a, Mana-in i châwm a, in tûr i pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kum sawmli chhûng thlalêrah khân An mamawh zawng zawng i tumsak a, An silhfênte lah a chul thei lo, An keruh pawh a na ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hnamte i hnehtîr a, an ram te i pe a, Hesbon lal Sihona ram an neihsak a, Basan lal Oga ram pawh an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vâna arsi zâtin an fate i tipung a, An pate hnêna pêk i tiam ram chu An la a, an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kanan ram chu an la a, Chûnga awmte chu i tihtlâwmsak a, Kanan mi leh an lalte chu An duh tâwkin i sawisaktîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I mite chuan kulh nei khuate an la a, Ram ṭha ṭha chu an nei ta a, In nuam tak takte chu an luah zêl a. Tuizêm siam sa an ring a, Thei tinrêng, oliv leh grep rah sa an tlân. An duh tâwk tâwk an ei, an sa a mâm thul mai. I thilpêk, thil ṭhate chu an tlân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I mite chuan i thu an awih duh ta lo va, An hel a, i Dân an pawisa lo. I lam hawi tûra fuihtu zâwlneite chu An that zêl a, an thamlo hle reng che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, an hmêlmate kutah i pe a, An lo timangang êm êm a, An rawn au che a, vân aṭangin i lo chhâng ṭhîn, I khawngaih a, hruaitute i pe a, Hmêlma lakah an vêng him ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Râlmuanga an awm chuan thil sual an ti leh mai ṭhîn a, An hmêlmate kutah i pe leh ṭhîn. An sima ṭanpui an dîl che chuan I lo khawngaih a, vân aṭangin i lo ngaithla a, I chhan chhuak leh mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I Dânte chu zâwm tûrin i hrilh ṭhîn a, An inchhuan êm avângin I thupêkte an zâwm duh lo. Mihring nun theih nâna awm dân tûr i ruatte chu An tihmawh leh luhlul avângin an zâwm duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A kum a têlin i zilh fo va, I zâwlneite thu i sawitîr ṭhîn, I mite chuan an beng an chhungawng a, An hmêlmate kutah i pe leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />I lainat êm avângin i thlahthlam lo va, I tiboral mai hek lo. Pathian ngilnei tak leh Mi khawngaih thei tak zawng i lo nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang zawng kan Pathian, Pathian ropui, Thil i titheiin i va hlauhawm êm!” I thuthlung chu i chelh tlat a, Asuria lalten min rawn lâk ata Tûn thlengin kan va rethei tak êm! Kan lal te, hruaitu te, puithiam te, zâwlnei te, Min thlahtute nên kan tuar tlâng a, Kan retheihzia hi ngainêp teh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nang chuan dik takin thil i ti a, Min hrem pawh hi i tidik e, Kan sual a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Min thlahtu te, kan lal te, Puithiam te leh hruaitu te chuan I Dân chu an zâwm duh lo. I thupêkte leh i thuruatte an pawisa lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />I pêk ram zau tak leh ṭha takah chuan an awm a, I duhsak a, lalte i pe a, Mahse, an sual an sim duh lo, I rawng an bâwl duh bawk hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tûnah pawh hian i ram min pêkah chuan bawih kan ni a, He ram ṭha tak, ei tûr tamna ramah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kan sual vânga kan chunga lal i dahte chuan Rama thil haw apiang an hui a, An duh duhin min sawisak hi, kan rante nên; Kan mangang êm êm mai.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Kan chunga thil lo thlengte avâng chuan min hruaitu te, Levia chi te, Puithiam te leh keini Israel mi te hian thu nghet takin kan tiam a, hming kan ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ramawptu Nehemia, Hakalia fapa chuan an thutiamah chuan hming a ziak hmasa ber a, Zedekian a ziak leh a. Hming ziaktu dangte chu hêngte hi an ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puithiamho zînga mi: Seraia, Azaria, Jeremia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasura, Amaria, Malkija,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatusa, Sebania, Maluka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harima, Meremota, Obadia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Daniela, Ginethona, Baruka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mesulama, Abija, Mijamina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maazia, Bilgaia leh Semaia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levia chi zînga hêngho hian hming an ziak bawk: Azania fapa Jesua, Henadada fate zîngah Binuia leh Kadmiela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An unau Sebania, Hodia, Kelita, Pelaia, Hanana,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mika, Rehoba, Hasabia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zakura, Serebia, Sebania,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hodia, Bania leh Beninua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipui hruaitu, hming ziak vete chu hêngte hi an ni: Parosa, Pahat-Moaba, Elama, Zatua, Bania,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bunia, Azgada, Bebaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Adonija, Bigvaia, Adina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Atera, Hezekia, Azura,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hodia, Hasuma, Bezaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Harifa, Anathota, Nebaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Magpiasa, Mesulama, Hezira,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mesezabela, Zadoka, Jadua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pelatia, Hanana, Anaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hosea, Hanania, Hasuba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Halohesa, Pilha, Sobeka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rehuma, Hasabna, Maaseia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahia, Hanana, Anana,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Maluka, Harima leh Baana.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel mi, puithiam te, Levia chi te, Tempul pulis te, zaipâwl te, Tempul enkawltu te leh mi dang, keiniho, Pathian Dân zâwm duhtute hian kan vêla awm hnam dangte laka inthiarfihlîma, chinchâng hre pha chin, kan nupui fanaute leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />min hruaitute nên hian Pathian Dân, a chhiahhlawh hmanga min pêk chu, zâwm tûrin chhia kan chham ta a ni. Lalpa kan lal thupêk zawng zawngte chu kan awih ang a, a thuruatte kan ti ang a, awm dân tûr a tih ang ngeia awm kan tiam ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kan rama hnam dang awm vete nên kan inneih pawlh lo vang. Hnam dangin sabat ni-ah leh ni serh dangah buh emaw, thil dang emaw min rawn zawrh pawhin kan lei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kum sarih kumin lo kan nei lo vang a, miin kan thil an bat zawng zawng kan ngaidam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kum tin, Tempula senso tûr tangkarua gram nga ṭheuh pêk kan tiam e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tempula rawngbâwlna tûr hêng pawh hi kan tum ang: Chhang serh, ni tina hâlral thilhlan tûr chhangphut, ni tina hâl ral tûr ran; sabat ni te, thla thar ni te, kût ni tea hâl ral tûr rante, Israel hnam pum sual thawina tûr ran te leh thil ṭûl apiang kan tum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dân bu-a sawi angin keini mipui te, puithiam te, Levia chi te hian Lalpa , kan Pathian hnêna thilhlan hâlna tûr thing tumtu kum tin ṭhumvâwrin kan thlang ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kum tin, kan buh seng hmasak ber leh kan theirah lawh hmasak berte chu Tempulah kan rawn hlân ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Fapa kan neih hmasak ber chu Tempula puithiam hnêna hruaiin, Dânin a phût angin Pathian tân kan hlân ang. Kan bâwngno hmasa ber te, kan berâm leh kêl no hrin hmasak ber te pawh Lalpa hnênah kan hlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tempula puithiam hnênah buh thar aṭanga kan chhang siam hmasak ber chu kum tin kan keng ang a, kan uain te, oliv hriak te leh thei dang rahte kan hlân bawk ang. Kan lova sâwma pakhat chu a chang tûra ruat Levia chite kan pe ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />sâwma pakhat lâk hunah Arona thlah puithiamte pawh pêk tûr an ni. Tempula dah tûrin Levia chite chuan an dawn apiang sâwma pakhat chu an pe ve ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israel mite leh Levia chite chuan buh te, uain te, oliv hriak an pêkte chu Jerusalem Tempulah, bungbêl dahnaah an dah ṭhîn tûr a ni; Tempula rawngbâwl tûr puithiam te, Tempul pulis te leh Tempul zaipâwl te awm ṭhinnaah chuan. Pathian in chu kan thlahthlam hauh lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnam hruaitute chu Jerusalem khuaah an awm a, chhûng sâwm zêla chhûng khat chu Jerusalem khaw thianghlima awm tûrin ṭhumvâwrin an thlang a; mi dang erawh chu khaw danga awm tûrin thingtlâng khuaahte an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaa awm tûra inpe peihte chu an ngaisâng hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel rama khawpui deuhvah leh khaw tê deuhva awm puithiam te, Levia chi te, Tempul enkawltute leh Solomona chhiahhlawh thlahte chu an awmna khuaah mahni in ngeiah an awm a ni. Judai rama mi, mi lâr deuh deuh Jerusalem khuaa awmte chu hêng hi an ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Juda thlahte zînga mi: Zekaria tupa, Uzia fa Athaia; ani hi Juda fapa Pereza thlah a ni, a pute chu Amaria te, Sefatia te, Mahalalela te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kolhozea tupa, Baruka fapa Maaseia; ani hi Juda fa Sela thlah zînga mi a ni. A pute chu Hazaia te, Adaia te, Joiariba te leh Zekaria te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pereza thlah mi zali leh sawmruk leh pariatin Jerusalem khuaah in leh lo an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamina thlahte zînga mi: Joeda tupa Mesulama fa Salua; a pute chu Pedaia te, Kolaia te, Maaseia te, Ithiela te leh Jesaia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Salua laichîn hnai Gabaia leh Salaia pawh Jerusalem-ah an awm. Benjamina thlah Jerusalem-a awm zawng zawng mi zakua leh sawmhnih leh pariat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zikria fapa Joela chu an hotu ber a ni a, Hasenua fapa Juda chu hotu ber dawttu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hêng puithiamte hi Jerusalem-ah an awm bawk: Joiariba fapa Jedaia leh Jakina.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mesulama tupa Hilkia fa Seraia. Ani hi a pute chu Zadoka te, Meraiota te leh Puithiam lalber Ahituba te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />He mite chi zariat leh sawmhnih leh pahnihin Tempulah rawng an bâwl ṭhîn. Pelaia tupa Jerohama fapa Adaia. Ani hi a pute chu Amazia te, Zekaria te, Pasura te leh Malkija te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An vaiin he chite hi an chhûngkaw hotute nên mi zahnih leh sawmli leh pahnih a ni. Ahzaia tupa, Azarela fa Amasaia. Ani hi a pute chu Mesilemota te leh Imera te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />He chi hi mi za leh sawmhnih leh pariat an awm, sipai huai tak tak an ni. An hotu chu chhûngkaw hung tak zînga mi Zabdiela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Levia chi Jerusalem-a awmte: Azrikama tupa, Hasuba fa Semaia. Ani hi a pute chu Hasabia te leh Bunia te an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sabethaia leh Jozabada. Anni hi Levia chi, mi lâr tak, Tempul pâwn lam hna enkawltu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asafa thlah, Zabdia tupa, Mika fapa Matania. Ani hi Tempul zaipâwl lâwm hla sak hruaitu a ni. Bakbukia: ani hi Matania puitu a ni. Galala tupa, Samua fa, Abda: ani hi Jeduthuna thlaha mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jerusalem khaw thianghlima Levia chi awm zawng zawng chu mi zahnih leh sawmriat leh pali an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tempul pulis Jerusalem-a awmte: Akuba te, Talmona te leh an chhûngte nên; an vaiin mi za leh sawmsarih leh pahnih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel mi dang chu puithiamte leh Levia chi dangte nên Judai ram khawpui deuhvah te leh khaw tê deuhvah te mahni inah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tempul enkawltute chu Jerusalem khaw chhûng ‘ofel’ an tih laiah chuan a bingin an awm a ni: Ziha leh Gispa hovin hna an thawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Levia chite zînga an hotu ber Jerusalem-a awm chu Hasabia tupa, Bania fa Uzia a ni. A pute chu Matania te leh Mika te an ni. Asafa thlahte zînga mi a ni a, Tempula thil ri thei tumtu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni tina an inthlâk kual dân tûr lal thupêk chu ziakin an dah ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda hnama mi, Zera thlah Mesezabela fa Pethahia chu Persia sawrkâra Israel mite aiawhtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi tam tak chu an huan ramah an awm thlih thliah a. Juda thlahte chu Judai ram khawpui Kiriat-arba-ah te, Dibon-ah te, Jekabzeel leh an khawperah te an awm ber a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesua khuaah te, Molada khuaah te leh Beth-pelet khuaah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-sual khawpuiah te leh Beer-seba-ah leh a chhehvêl khuaah te an awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziklag leh Mekona khua leh a chhehvêl khuaah te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En-rimon-ah te, Zora-ah te, Jarmut-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanoa-ah te, Adulam-ah te leh an chhehvêl khuaah te pawh an awm a. Lakis-ah leh a chhehvêl huanah te, Azeka leh a khawperah te an awm bawk a. Juda thlahte chu chhim lamah Beer-seba, hmâr lamah Hinom ruam inkâr ramah an awm ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamina thlahte chu Geba-ah te, Mikmas-ah te, Ai-ah te, Bethel-ah te leh an vêl khawperah te an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anathot-ah te, Nob-ah te, Anania-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor-ah te, Rama-ah te, Zeboim-ah te, Nebalat-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hadid-ah te, Zeboim-ah te, Nebalat-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lod-ah te, Ono-ah te, themthiamho ruamah te an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Judai rama awm ṭhîn Levia chi mi ṭhenkhat chu Benjamin-ho zîngah an awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sealtiela fapa Zerubabela leh puithiam lalber Jesua ruala saltâng haw vete chu hêng hi an ni: Puithiamho: Seraia, Jeremia, Ezra,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaria, Maluka, Hatusa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sekania, Rehuma, Meremota,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ido-a, Ginethoia, Abija,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mijamina, Maadia, Bilga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Semaia, Joiariba, Jedaia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Salua, Amoka, Hilkia leh Jedaia. Hêngho hi Jesua hun laia puithiam thlah hrang hotute chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Levia chite: Tempula inkhâwmnaah lâwmthu sawina hla hruaitu Levia chite chu hêng hi an ni: Jesua, Binuia, Kadmiela, Serebia, Juda leh Matania te hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêngho hi zaipâwl hla sak lo chhâwn ṭhîntute chu an ni: Bakbukia te leh Unoa te leh an Levia chipui te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesua fa chu Joiakima a ni, chu mi fa chu Eliasiba a ni, ani chu Joiada pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joiada fa chu Jonathana, Jadua pa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joiakima hun laia puithiam thlah hrang hrang hotute chu hêng hi an ni: Seraia thlah zînga hotu chu Meraria a ni a, Jeremia thlah zînga hotu chu Hanania a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ezra thlah zînga hotu chu Mesulama a ni a, Amaria thlah zînga hotu chu Johanana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Maluka thlah zînga hotu chu Jonathana a ni a, Sebania thlah zînga hotu chu Josefa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harima thlah zînga hotu chu Adna a ni a, Meraiota thlah zînga hotu chu Helkaia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ido-a thlah zînga hotu chu Zekaria a ni a, Ginethona thlah zînga hotu chu Mesulama a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abija thlah zînga hotu chu Zikria a ni a, Miniamina thlah zînga hotu chu Moadia thlah zînga hotu chu Piltaia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bilga thlah zînga hotu chu Samua a ni a, Semaia thlah zînga hotu chu Jehonathana a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Joiariba thlah zînga hotu chu Matenaia a ni a, Jedaia thlah zînga hotu chu Uzia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Salaia thlah zînga hotu chu Kalaia a ni a, Amoka thlah zînga hotu chu Ebera a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hilkia thlah zînga hotu chu Hasabia a ni a, Jedaia thlah zînga hotu chu Nethanela a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng puithiam lalber Eliasiba te, Joiada te, Johanana te, Jadua te hun lai hian Levia chite leh puithiamhote chu an thlahtute chhui chhuaha, chhinchhiah fel a ni. Daria kha Persia lal a lo nih kha chuan ziak chhuah fel a ni tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eliasiba tupa Johanana hun aṭang chauhvin Levia chite chu an chhûngkaw hotu hming chhui chhuaha ziak fel a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hasabia te, Serebia te, Jesua te, Binuia te leh Kadmiela te kaihhruaiin Levia chite hi a pâwl pâwlin an inṭhen a, ṭum khatah pâwl hnihin Pathian fak hla an sa ṭhîn, pâwl khatin an sa phawt a, pâwl dangin an lo chhâwn ṭhîn. Lal Davida remruat ang khân an la ti zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hêngho hi Tempul pulis hotu, Tempul kudâm leh kawngkhâr vêngtute chu an ni: Matania te, Bakbukia te, Obadia te, Mesulama te, Talmona leh Akuba te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesua fapa Joiakima, Jozadaka tupa te, Ramawptu Nehemia te, puithiam leh lehkhathiam Ezra te hun laiin hêng mite hian hna an thawk ṭan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem khaw kulh bang siam zawh an lawm dâwn chuan dârbenthek te, perhkhuang te nêna lâwm hla sa tûrin Levia chite chu khawia awm pawh an chah khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Levia chi, hla sa mi, Jerusalem leh a chhehvêla awmte leh Netofa khawpui leh a chhehvêla awmte chu an lo pung khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Beth-gilgal aṭang te, Geba aṭang te, Asmavet khua aṭang te pawhin an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Puithiamte leh Levia chite chu an inthian thianghlim a, mipui te leh kulh bang te pawh an thian thianghlim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Judai rama hotute chu kulh bang chung zâwlah chuan ka hruai a, pâwl hnihah an inṭhen a. Khawpui kulh bang chung zâwlah chuan Pathian fak chungin an kal kual a. Pâwl khat chu bang chung zâwla kalin Bawlhhlawh Kawngkhâr lam, ding lam panin an kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Zaipâwlin hma an hruai a, Hosaia hovin Judai ram hotu zâtve chuan an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hêng puithiam - Azaria te, Ezra te, Mesulama te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Juda te, Benjamina te, Semaia te leh Jeremia te hian an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt nên hêng puithiam fapate hian an zui: Jonathana fapa Zekaria, Semaia tupa (Ani hi a pute chu Matania te, Mikaia te leh Zakura te. Asafa thlah an ni) chuan hma a hruai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />a chipui Semaia te, Azarela te, Milalaia te, Gilalaia te, Maaia te, Nethanela te, Juda te, Hanania te chuan an zui a. Pathian mi, lal Davida tum ṭhin ang perhkhuang te kha an keng bawk a, lehkhathiam Ezra chuan hma a hruai bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuikhur Kawngkhâr an thlen chuan Davida khaw chhohna kailâwnah an chho va, Davida in an kal pêl a, khawpui chhak lam dep Meipui Kawngka bulah chuan an lo kal kual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Pâwl dang, lâwm hla saho chu kulh bang chung zâwlah chuan vei lam panin an kal a. Mipui pung khâwm zâtve dangte nên chuan kan zui a. Meichhehna In sâng kan kal pêl a, kulh bang chhah kan thleng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Efraim Kawngkhâr te, Jesina Kawngkhâr te, Sangha Kawngkhâr te, Hananela in sâng te, Hamea in sâng te, Berâm Kawngkhâr te kan kal pêl a, Tempul bul kawngkhâr kan thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathian faka kalhote chu Tempul tualah kan intâwk khâwm ta a. Ka bula kal hruaitute bâkah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />hêng mite hi ka ruala kal vete chu an ni: puithiam rual tawtawrâwt hâmtute chu Eliakima, Maaseia, Miniamina, Mikaia, Elioenaia, Zekaria leh Hanania.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hêng mite hian an rawn dawt a: Maaseia, Semaia, Eleazara, Uzia, Jehohanana, Malkija, Elama leh Ezera. Zaipâwl Jezrahia ho chuan an râwl tâwpin hla an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan thil tam tak kan hlân a, Pathianin min tihlim a, mipui chu an lâwm êm êm a ni. Hmeichhia leh naupangte pawh a lawmnaah hian an tel a, an thâwm chu hla tak aṭang pawhin a hriat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tempul thawhlâwm te, buh leh thei hmin hmasa sâwma pakhat te dah khâwma enkawltu tûrte kan ruat bawk a. Dânin a phût ang, puithiamte leh Levia chite hlawh tûr khaw tina lo leh huan aṭanga khawntu atân chûng mite chu ruat an ni nghâl a. Judai rama mite chu puithiam leh Levia chite chungah an lâwm hle a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />inthen thianghlim hnate leh Pathian thupêk anga tih tûr dang taima taka an tih ṭhîn avângin. Tempul zaipâwl te leh Tempul pulis te pawhin lal Davida leh a fapa Solomona dân siam ang khân engkim an ti thlap zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hmânlai ata lal Davida leh thil tum thiam Asafa hun aṭang tawh khân thil tum thiam mite hian Tempula lâwmthu sawina leh fakna hla sakte hi an hruai ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Zerubabela leh Nehemia hun aṭangin mipuiin Tempul zaipâwl leh Tempul pulis te hlawh tûr ni tin thawhlâwm an pe ṭhîn, Levia chite tân pawh thilhlan an pe ṭhîn; Levia chite chuan puithiamte chu thilhlan an sem ve ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia dân bu an han chhiar chuan Amon mite leh Moab mite chu Israel-ho zînga telh ve ngai loh tûr an nih thu a lo chuang reng mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amon mite leh Moab mite hian, Israel-te Aigupta ram aṭanga an lo chhuah khân chaw leh tui in tûr takngial pawh an lo pe duh lovin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel-te ânchhe lawh tûrin Balaama an ruai zâwk a nih kha; mahse, Pathianin ânchhia chu malsâwmnaah a chantîr ta hlauh zâwk pawh a ni. He dân hi Israel miten an hriat chuan an zîng aṭangin hnam dangte chu an thlauhthla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Puithiam Eliasiba, Tempul kudâm enkawltu leh Tobia hi rei tak an lo inkâwmngeih tawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pindan zau tâwk tak pakhat, buh leh rimtui te, Tempula bungbêl hman tûr te, puithiamte tâna thilpêk te, buh te, uain te leh oliv hriak, sâwma pakhat, Levia chiten Tempul zaipâwl te leh Tempul pulis te tâna an pêk dahkhâwmna tûrah chuan Tobia chu a thlentîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutianga a thlentîr ṭhin lai chuan kei chu Jerusalem-ah ka awm lo; Babulon-ah lal Artazerzia lal kum sawmthum leh pahnih kum chuan chanchin hrilh tûrin ka hâwng a ni. Nakin deuhvah chuan kîr leh min phalsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah chuan ka haw leh ta a. Eliasiban Tempul pindan pakhata Tobia a lo awmtîr ka hmuh chuan mak ka ti êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thin a ur hle a, Tobia thawmhnaw zawng zawng chu ka theh chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pindan chu thian thianghlim tûrin thu ka pe a, Tempul bungbêl te, buhbâl thilpêk te, rimtui hâl tûrte dah kîr leh tûrin thu ka pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipuiin ei tûr tâwk an pêk ṭhat loh avângin Tempul zaipâwl te leh Levia chi te chu an awmna ṭhin an in leh lovah an lo haw deuh vek tawh tih ka hre bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tempul an ngaihsak loh avângin hotute chu ka hau va, Levia chite leh zaipâwlte chu Tempulah ka ko kîr a; an hna an thawk ṭan leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel mi zawng zawng chuan an buh te, an uain te, an oliv hriak sâwma pakhat te chu tempulah an rawn keng leh ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tempul kudâm enkawl tûr chuan hêng mite hi ka dah a: Puithiam Selemia te, Dân thiam Zadoka te, Levia chi Pedaia te hi. Anni puituah Zakura fapa Hanana, Matania tupa chu ka dah bawk a. Anni hi an thawhpuite hnênah dik taka thil sem tûra ka rinte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, i Tempul rawngbâwlna atâna ka thiltihte hi hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Judai ramah mi ṭhenkhat chuan sabat niin grep an rap sâwr a, ṭhenkhatin sabengtungte chu Jerusalem-a zawrh tûrin buh te, uain te, oliv hriak te, sabat niah an phurhtîr a. Chuvângin, sabat nia thil hralh chu kan khap ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tura khaw mi, Jerusalem-a awmte chuan, sanghate leh thil dang chi hrang hrang Jerusalem khuaah sabat nia hralh tûr an rawn la ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Juda hruaitute chu ka hau va, “Thil sual tak in ti alâwm, sabat ni in bawhchhiat hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In thlahtuten hetianga sabat an bawhchhiat avângin alâwm a hrem che ua, khua hi a rawn tihchhiat kha! Sabat ni bawhchhiain Israel-te chungah Pathian thinurna tihthlen belh in tum tlat a nih hi!” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chuvângin, sabat ni a inṭan aṭangin khawpui kulh kawngkhâr chu ka khârtîr a, sabat ni a ral hma chu kawng hawng lo tûrin thu ka pe bawk a. Sabat niin khawpuiah tu man eng mah an lâk luh theih loh nân kawngkhâr zawng zawng chu keima mite ngei ka vêntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ṭum hnih khat chu thil tinrêng rawn zuar ṭhînte chu khawpui kulh pâwnah Zirtâwpni zân chu an riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Khatah riak tawh suh u, a sâwt lo, khatianga in tih leh chuan in chungah kut ka rawn thlâk tawh ang,” ka ti a. Chuta chin chu sabat niin an lo kal leh tawh ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Levia chite chu inthian thianghlim tûrin ka hrilh a, sabat ni chu serh ngei a nih theih nân kawngkhârahte chuan ka chântîr a. Aw ka Pathian, hei vâng pawh hian min hre reng la, khawngaih takin min zuah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Juda pa tam tak chuan Asdod nula te, Amon nula te, Moab nula te nupuiah an nei tih ka hmu chhuak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An fa zâtve dâwn lai chuan Asdod-ho ṭawng emaw, ṭawng dang emaw an hmang a, kan ṭawngin an ṭawng hlei thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chûng mite chu ka hau va, ânchhia ka lawh a, a ṭhen phei chu ka vua a, an samte pawh ka pawhsak a. Hnam dangte nên, an fate chen pawhin, inneih pawlh loh tûrin Pathian hming chhâlin chhia ka chhamtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Hnam dang hmeichhiaten alâwm lal Solomona pawh kha thil sual tihtîr. Hnam dang lal zawng zawng aia ropui a ni a, Pathian pawhin a hmangaih a, Israel zawng zawng lalah a siam a; mahse, he thil sual hi a tih tâk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian thu awih lovin hnam dang hmeichhia nangni angin kan nei ve mai dâwn em ni ang?” tiin ka chhâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Puithiam lalber Eliasiba fapa Joiada chuan Sanbalata fanu nupuiah a nei a, ani chu Beth-horon mi a ni. Jerusalem khua ata Joiada chu ka hnawt chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, hêng mite hian puithiam hming an tichhia a, puithiamte leh Levia chite nêna in thuthlung an bawhchhiat dân hi hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hnam dangte nêna inhnamhnawihna zawng zawng ata mipui chu ka thian thianghlim a, puithiam leh Levia chite chu mahni tih tûr an hriat ṭheuh theih nân dân ka siamsak thlap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlan hâlna tûr thingte chu a hun taka rawn keuh ziah tûrin hna ka sem a, mipui pawh buh thar hmasa leh thei hmin hmasa rawn ken hun tûr ka hrilh bawk a. Aw ka Pathian, hêng zawng zawng hi hre reng la, ka thiltih ṭhatah min pawmsak ang che.
  </para>
</usx>
